{"action": "shared_understanding_confirmed", "at": "2026-09-30T18:31:44+00:00", "data": {"summary": "Fixed bundle component snapshot: a trusted server-owned definition lists existing catalog products and per-bundle quantities sold together at a Commerce-owned set price. This slice exports an unmounted fulfillment projection that resolves component identity, SKU, and name from the catalog public read entry and multiplies quantities for a purchased bundle count. Shopper-configurable membership is excluded. The module does not price, declare sellability, contact Inventory, or create orders. Catalog still has only simple-product; checkout and order still lack a component snapshot. Authoritative set-price, order freeze, runtime mount, and managed-provider reservation remain deferred. Core projection is verified independently and does not gate Commerce v1."}, "event_id": "c0acd6ef-f001-412d-afbc-46f2c5dafa03"}
